| File/Folder | Purpose | Last Updated |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/App.jsx` | Main application logic, routing, and UI components (Customer & Manager Portals) | 2026-10-23 |
| `src/styles.css` | Global styles, layout, and theme definitions | 2026-10-23 |
| `index.html` | Entry point for the frontend application | 2026-10-23 |
| `vite.config.js` | Vite build and development configuration | 2026-10-23 |
| `package.json` | Frontend dependencies and scripts | 2026-10-23 |

